msgctxt "[\"Mint-Welcome\",\"mintwelcome_sv.po\",\"\",\"199\",\"4deac8a24bfea372f0f4adaf\"]"
msgid "There are about 60,000 applications available. Linux Mint comes with the bare minimum to get you started. The Software Manager is there if you're looking for more."
msgstr "Det finns ungefär 60.000 program i våra paketförråd. Linux Mint har bara de viktigaste förinstallerade så att du kan komma igång. Använd Programhanteraren om du vill installera fler."

# Review: 53954bbbaf112914fe5dfbe5
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/867f2aacbc1144c749cc7b2d9654b861937140e6/Mint-Welcome/mintwelcome_sv.po
# Evidence-SHA256: 53585fb4385e5fe61f1d5369be82f26300ae19e4e462a3d9ffdda1e2ae9519e7
# Source-evidence: {}
# Publication: review-commit
#. Review-note (JSON): "Bilingual translation changed in reviewed commit: archive reviewed Swedish Mint Welcome translation"
msgctxt "[\"Mint-Welcome\",\"mintwelcome_sv.po\",\"\",\"142\",\"53954bbbaf112914fe5dfbe5\"]"
msgid "Check the Driver Manager to see if it recommends any additional drivers for your computer. Most hardware components are recognized by the Linux kernel and work automatically without the need to install drivers. Some however require proprietary drivers to be recognized or to work better."
msgstr "Kontrollera Drivrutinshanteraren för att se om den rekommenderar ytterligare drivrutiner till datorn. De flesta maskinvarukomponenter identifieras av Linuxkärnan och fungerar automatiskt utan drivrutiner. Vissa kräver dock proprietära drivrutiner för att identifieras eller fungera bättre."

# Review: 59914558a1ab0a9355b843a6
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/867f2aacbc1144c749cc7b2d9654b861937140e6/Mint-Welcome/mintwelcome_sv.po
